You may not operate Covered Software for third parties, provide third-party
accounts or access to its platform capabilities, or offer hosting, SaaS, PaaS,
API access, dedicated or managed cloud services, outsourced operation, or paid
services whose substance is delivery or operation of the Covered Software.
Free access, advertising, lead generation, indirect payment, rebranding,
interface changes or additional wrappers do not create an exception. Mere
delivery of Your own independent work product is not such operation.

These restrictions apply before and after Enterprise activation. There is no
additional paid authorization or approval exception for these activities under
this license. Licensor's own publication and distribution of materials that
Licensor is entitled to license are not third-party redistribution by You.
Receiving EE frontend resources in a browser does not relicense them as MIT or
Apache-2.0. A restriction here does not override Section 2 or mandatory legal
